id: pm-web-8pml
title: Repair SDK update automation and certify pm-web on published CLI 2026.10.10
description: "Update PM CLI/SDK, pm-changelog, and pm-ops package and lockfile pins from 2026.9.23 to current registry releases, verify installed runtime versions, then rerun the complete release and packed npm/Bun acceptance gates. Keep the public package and private hosted deployment boundaries separate."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-26T16:15:15.599Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-10T17:07:12.905Z"
author: codex
acceptance_criteria: "Exact published CLI/SDK 2026.10.10 and current published pm-ops/pm-changelog pins, all devDependencies exact; dependency-only automated SDK updates keep a separately certified exact extension-host floor, exercised by packed npm/native Bun acceptance on minimum and current hosts without generated tracked edits; red-first and behavioral fail-on-revert proof; full unchanged CI/release gate and strict pinned health, both audits clean, real disposable PostgreSQL collaboration checks; retain independent whole-source/privacy/hosted/reviewer boundaries and keep this item open for orchestrator verification."
actual_result: "Published SDK2026.10.10 only; sourcecommit01b82d6f111b80b0b1412abb0707f79c3b1bd44e. Both unchanged exact-tree linked releases492/492 zero skips at440.995/591.292s within1800/2400s. Last partial34server coverage S/L90.38 B80.18 F93.43, counters10331/11430,1773/2211,256/274; docsselected95/625, duplicate0/45033/156. Four npm/nativeBun minimum10.4/current10.10 hosts and standalone10.10 pass both actual identical archives; PG17.10 sixcollaboration cases and sixgraph cases, packaging5/5 pass. Last fullgraph2000read3111ms,focused1787ms/10000ms. Prod audit0; real dev4high xucb staysopen. Oldlink trustrefusal/usageerror preserved; reviewed clone-only trust followed by actual run. Histories/prefixes preserved, ownclaimreleased, no otherowner changes/itemsclosed. Source/test/dist behavior unchanged; whole-source/docs/privacy/scale/review/hosted gaps remain; no deployment/publish/merge/GH messages."
